      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Column (1) Column (2) Title Amount (RM) Parliament of Malaysia 83,365,600 Keeper of Rulers’ Seal Office National Audit Department 80,418,750 Election Commission 32,771,650 Public Services Commission 21,190,100 Prime Minister’s Department 2,169,205,150 Public Service Department 235,750,800 Attorney General’s Chambers 99,171,550 Malaysian Anti-Corruption Commission 156,207,800 Treasury 2,100,000,000 Treasury General Services 28,118,860,750 Contribution to Statutory Funds 1,096,537,250 Ministry of Foreign Affairs 404,806,900 Ministry of National Unity 270,797,650 Ministry of Economy 265,488,150 Ministry of Plantation and Commodities 120,500,000 Ministry of Agriculture and Food Security 2,382,552,500 Ministry of Rural and Regional 1,808,183,850 Development Ministry of Natural Resources, Environment 837,347,200 and Climate Change Ministry of International Trade and 312,548,250 Industry Ministry of Domestic Trade and Cost of 845,905,700 Living Ministry of Entrepreneur and Cooperatives 106,070,700 Development Column (1) Purpose Title B. 27 Ministry of Works B. 28 Ministry of Transport B. 30 Ministry of Science, Technology and Innovation B. 31 Ministry of Tourism, Arts and Culture B. 40 Education Service Commission B. 42 Ministry of Health B. 43 Ministry of Local Government Development B. 45 Ministry of Youth and Sports B. 46 Ministry of Human Resources B. 47 Ministry of Communications and Digital B. 48 Ministry of Women, Family and Community Development B. 60 Ministry of Defence B. 62 Ministry of Home Affairs B. 63 Ministry of Education B. 64 Ministry of Higher Education TOTAL"
